                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I mwaka me aŋwen me loc pa Yekoyakim wod pa Yocia kabaka me Juda, en aye Baruk wod pa Neria ocoyo iye lok ma Jeremia owaco bote kikore kikore. Ci lanebi Jeremia owaco bot Baruk ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Rwot, Lubaŋa pa Icrael, owaco kuman ni, Baruk, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in iwacci, ‘Can i wiya gira! Rwot dok omedo cwercwiny i kom arem ma atye kwede. Doŋ aol woko ki cur dok pe alimo yweyo mo wacel!’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
